OL,3,GNEWSAWoman with bowel condition turned
OL,4,Aaway from disabled toilets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman with Crohn's disease has told
OL,7,Fhow she has been denied access to
OL,8,Faccessible toilets by people who do not
OL,9,Funderstand the condition, and has even
OL,10,Fbeen asked to "prove" she has a
OL,11,Fdisability.
OL,13,FVictoria Danson was diagnosed with the
OL,14,Fchronic inflammatory bowel condition
OL,15,Fwhen she was 19, and is also undergoing
OL,16,Ftreatment for a form of pancreatic
OL,17,Fcancer.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
