OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWoman with bowel condition turned
OL,4,Aaway from disabled toilets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 37-year-old from Chorley,
OL,7,FLancashire, is calling for businesses
OL,8,Fto better educate security staff on
OL,9,Faccessible toilets after a series of
OL,10,Fexperiences where she was denied
OL,11,Faccess.
OL,13,F"I should be able to enjoy a night out
OL,14,Fwithout being question. There needs to
OL,15,Fbe more information available to these
OL,16,Fcompanies about who needs this and why
OL,17,Fthey might need it," she said.
